WEBVTT

00:00:02.897 --> 00:00:03.849
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Part 4

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:08.863
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> I think he’s Nadine’s hair stylist.

00:00:09.372 --> 00:00:12.932
He works inside, other people help him…

00:00:13.257 --> 00:00:15.268
<v><b>George:</b></v> But he doesn’t work on weekends.

00:00:15.499 --> 00:00:18.049
Hair stylists work on Saturdays…

00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:20.305
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> Not all hair stylists.

00:00:20.829 --> 00:00:23.028
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> He isn’t a chef, I’m sure.

00:00:23.544 --> 00:00:25.620
Restaurants are full on weekends.

00:00:26.295 --> 00:00:31.064
And James says he cooks French food, but his specialty is spaghetti carbonara.

00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:32.889
That’s Italian!

00:00:33.556 --> 00:00:35.487
I think he’s a hair stylist, too.

00:00:35.947 --> 00:00:38.011
<v><b>George:</b></v> But Nadine says they are friends,

00:00:38.662 --> 00:00:42.197
and then she says, “I don’t think he has children.”

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:45.681
She doesn’t know. I think that’s strange.

00:00:46.451 --> 00:00:48.852
I think he’s Tyler’s dentist.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.416
He has special qualifications,

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.615
and remember, “People don’t always like me.”

00:00:55.714 --> 00:00:56.984
Nobody likes dentists.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:59.175
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> We need to agree.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:00.966
<v><b>George:</b></v> I’m sure he’s a dentist.

00:01:01.306 --> 00:01:04.353
<v><b>Alice and Charlie:</b></v> No, definitely a hair stylist.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.416
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Your time’s up, Team B.

00:01:08.844 --> 00:01:11.227
So, what’s Mike’s job?

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:14.105
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> We think he’s a hair stylist.

00:01:14.716 --> 00:01:16.898
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Mike, what do you do?

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.397
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> I’m Tyler’s dentist.

00:01:23.455 --> 00:01:26.251
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Yes, Mike is Tyler’s dentist.

00:01:26.605 --> 00:01:30.308
He says nobody likes dentists, but we like you, Mike!

00:01:30.936 --> 00:01:32.840
Thank you very much, everyone!